{"name":"抽屉","description":"从屏幕边缘滑出的覆盖层面板，用于展示承载较多内容的辅助操作。 · 在项目列表旁查看详情或调整筛选时可打开抽屉。无论在手机上占满屏幕还是只占一侧，都需要清楚的标题、关闭入口和焦点管理。","quote":"从右边滑出来一块面板看详情，背后的列表还能看见。","agentPrompt":"在订单列表右侧打开编辑收货地址的抽屉，保留背景订单和原滚动位置。抽屉要有标题、关闭入口和保存反馈；请验证键盘焦点、关闭返回位置以及小屏布局。","html":"<div class=\"detail-body detail-entry-drawer\"><section class=\"detail-hero\" id=\"detail-hero\"><div class=\"dh-head\"><h1>抽屉<span>Drawer</span></h1></div><div class=\"dh-quote\"><span class=\"dh-quote-label\">你可能会说</span><p class=\"dh-quote-text\">从右边滑出来一块面板看详情，背后的列表还能看见。</p></div><div class=\"dh-tagline\"><strong class=\"dh-summary-lead\">从屏幕边缘滑出的覆盖层面板，用于展示承载较多内容的辅助操作。</strong><span class=\"dh-summary-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>在项目列表旁查看详情或调整筛选时可打开抽屉。无论在手机上占满屏幕还是只占一侧，都需要清楚的标题、关闭入口和焦点管理。</span></div><div class=\"alias-row\" aria-label=\"也常被叫作\"><span>也常被叫作</span><em>抽屉组件</em><em>侧边滑出面板</em><em>侧边抽屉</em></div><div class=\"dh-demo\"><div class=\"dh-demo-viewport\"><div class=\"dh-demo-inner\"><div class=\"drawer-scene\"><div class=\"dm-skel\"><i style=\"width:70%\"></i><i style=\"width:85%\"></i><i style=\"width:60%\"></i></div><div class=\"drawer-mask\"></div><div class=\"drawer-panel\"><div class=\"drawer-head\">任务详情 <span>×</span></div><i class=\"drawer-line\" style=\"width:90%\"></i><i class=\"drawer-line\" style=\"width:75%\"></i><i class=\"drawer-line\" style=\"width:82%\"></i><div class=\"drawer-foot\"><span class=\"btn btn-outline\">关闭</span><span class=\"btn btn-primary\">保存</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"lesson-extras\"><section class=\"lesson-agent-prompt\" aria-labelledby=\"lesson-agent-title\"><h2 id=\"lesson-agent-title\">你可以这样告诉 AI Agent</h2><blockquote><span class=\"lesson-agent-quote\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span><p>在订单列表右侧打开编辑收货地址的抽屉，保留背景订单和原滚动位置。抽屉要有标题、关闭入口和保存反馈；请验证键盘焦点、关闭返回位置以及小屏布局。</p></blockquote></section></div><div class=\"usage-grid\"><div class=\"usage-box use\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.2 4.2L19 7\"></path></svg></span>什么时候用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>列表点开看详情</b>：不跳页，看完关掉接着逛</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-scene\"><div class=\"mk-skel\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:80%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:60%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:70%\"></i></div><div class=\"mk-mask\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;right:0;width:58%;background:var(--bg);padding:7px 8px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;box-shadow:-3px 0 10px rgba(29,33,41,.15);font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\"><span style=\"font-weight:600;color:var(--text)\">任务详情</span><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:92%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:78%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:85%\"></i></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>筛选条件面板</b>：选项多，弹窗放不下</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-scene\"><div class=\"mk-skel\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:80%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:60%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:70%\"></i></div><div class=\"mk-mask\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;right:0;width:58%;background:var(--bg);padding:7px 8px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;box-shadow:-3px 0 10px rgba(29,33,41,.15);font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\"><span style=\"font-weight:600;color:var(--text)\">筛选</span><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-box on\"></i>进行中</span><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-box\"></i>已完成</span><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"margin-top:auto;justify-content:flex-end\"><span class=\"mk-btn primary\">确定</span></div></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>稍长的二级表单</b>：编辑资料、添加成员</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-scene\"><div class=\"mk-skel\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:80%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:60%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:70%\"></i></div><div class=\"mk-mask\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;right:0;width:58%;background:var(--bg);padding:7px 8px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;box-shadow:-3px 0 10px rgba(29,33,41,.15);font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\"><span style=\"font-weight:600;color:var(--text)\">编辑成员</span><span class=\"mk-input\" style=\"min-width:0\">林小hu</span><span class=\"mk-input\" style=\"min-width:0\"><em>邮箱</em></span><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"margin-top:auto;justify-content:flex-end\"><span class=\"mk-btn primary\">保存</span></div></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>移动端导航菜单</b>：从左侧滑出的经典用法</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-scene\"><div class=\"mk-skel\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:80%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:60%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:70%\"></i></div><div class=\"mk-mask\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;left:0;width:46%;background:var(--bg);padding:7px 8px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;box-shadow:3px 0 10px rgba(29,33,41,.15);font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\"><span style=\"color:var(--brand);font-weight:600\">首页</span><span>组件</span><span>模板</span><span>设置</span></div></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"usage-box dont\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7l10 10M17 7 7 17\"></path></svg></span>什么时候不用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">确认危险操作：使用 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/modal?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"modal\" aria-label=\"弹窗 Modal\">弹窗 <b>Modal</b></a> 让任务更聚焦</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-scene\"><div class=\"mk-skel\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:80%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:60%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:70%\"></i></div><div class=\"mk-mask\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;right:0;width:58%;background:var(--bg);padding:7px 8px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;box-shadow:-3px 0 10px rgba(29,33,41,.15);font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\"><span style=\"font-weight:600;color:var(--text)\">确认删除？</span><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:80%\"></i><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"margin-top:auto;justify-content:flex-end\"><span class=\"mk-btn outline\">取消</span><span class=\"mk-btn danger\">删除</span></div></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">只有简短内容：使用 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/popover?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"popover\" aria-label=\"气泡卡片 Popover\">气泡卡片 <b>Popover</b></a> 或 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/tooltip?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"tooltip\" aria-label=\"文字提示 Tooltip\">文字提示 <b>Tooltip</b></a></div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-scene\"><div class=\"mk-skel\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:80%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:60%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:70%\"></i></div><div class=\"mk-mask\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;right:0;width:58%;background:var(--bg);padding:7px 8px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;box-shadow:-3px 0 10px rgba(29,33,41,.15);font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\"><span style=\"font-weight:600;color:var(--text)\">统计</span><span>共 3 条记录</span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">在抽屉内继续打开抽屉：层级会难以返回和理解</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-scene\"><div class=\"mk-skel\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:80%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:60%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:70%\"></i></div><div class=\"mk-mask\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;right:0;width:58%;background:var(--bg);padding:7px 8px;box-shadow:-3px 0 10px rgba(29,33,41,.15)\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:90%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:70%\"></i></div><div style=\"position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;right:24%;width:46%;background:var(--bg);padding:7px 8px;box-shadow:-3px 0 10px rgba(29,33,41,.2);border-left:1px solid var(--border)\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:85%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:65%\"></i></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">多步骤长流程：使用新页面配合 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/steps?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"steps\" aria-label=\"步骤条 Steps\">步骤条 <b>Steps</b></a></div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-steps\"><span class=\"mk-step on\"><i>1</i>填写信息</span><span class=\"mk-step-bar\"></span><span class=\"mk-step on\"><i>2</i>确认订单</span><span class=\"mk-step-bar\"></span><span class=\"mk-step \"><i>3</i>完成支付</span></div></div></div></li></ul></div></div><section><div class=\"section-title\">组成结构 · Anatomy</div><div class=\"anat-wrap\"><div class=\"anat-stage\"><div class=\"drawer-anat\"><div class=\"drawer-anat-page\"><i class=\"drawer-line\" style=\"width:70%\"></i><i class=\"drawer-line\" style=\"width:88%\"></i><i class=\"drawer-line\" style=\"width:55%\"></i></div><div class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"panel\"><div class=\"drawer-anat-panel\"><div class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"head\"><div class=\"drawer-anat-head\">任务详情 <span>×</span></div></div><div class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"body\"><div class=\"drawer-anat-body\"><i class=\"drawer-line\" style=\"width:92%\"></i><i class=\"drawer-line\" style=\"width:78%\"></i><i class=\"drawer-line\" style=\"width:85%\"></i><i class=\"drawer-line\" style=\"width:64%\"></i></div></div><div class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"foot\"><div class=\"drawer-anat-foot\"><span class=\"btn btn-outline\">关闭</span><span class=\"btn btn-primary\">保存</span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"anat-parts\"><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"panel\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">1</span><span class=\"pn\">抽屉面板</span><span class=\"pe\">Drawer</span></button><span class=\"pd\">贴边滑出的容器，只遮住部分页面</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"head\"><button class=\"anat-